        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "team_0020_cassiopeia_11",
      "hash64": "062DFB805A9020B2",
      "text": "Bando alle ciance. Ora vi spiegherò in cosa\\nconsiste l’Operazione Stardust.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "team_0020_nelke_12",
      "hash64": "08278BF2E557688F",
      "text": "Qual è, concretamente, la nostra missione?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "team_0020_cassiopeia_12",
      "hash64": "062DFA805A901EFF",
      "text": "Per farla breve... Dovete penetrare nelle basi\\ndel Team Star.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "team_0020_cassiopeia_13",
      "hash64": "062DF9805A901D4C",
      "text": "Una volta lì, individuate le persone a capo\\ndi ogni banda, sconfiggetele e deponetele![VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "team_0020_nelke_13",
      "hash64": "08278AF2E55766DC",
      "text": "Cioè? Vuoi che le costringiamo ad abbandonare\\nil loro ruolo?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "team_0020_cassiopeia_14",
      "hash64": "062DF8805A901B99",
      "text": "Esatto. Il Team Star è composto da cinque\\nbande, ognuna con la sua base.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "team_0020_cassiopeia_15",
      "hash64": "062DF7805A9019E6",
      "text": "Vicino a voi dovrebbe esserci giusto il cancello\\ndi una di queste basi.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "team_0020_nelke_14",
      "hash64": "082789F2E5576529",
      "text": "Ah, eccolo. Lo vedo.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "team_0020_cassiopeia_16",
      "hash64": "062DF6805A901833",
      "text": "Oltre quel cancello c’è una delle basi\\nche cerchiamo.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "team_0020_cassiopeia_17",
      "hash64": "062DF5805A901680",
      "text": "E da qualche parte all’interno, c’è uno dei\\ncapibanda che dovrete sconfiggere.[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
